    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir32">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e98">Caput 32</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_1@1-1">Rectorem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir32-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir32-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e113">Qui dignitate praeest, non debet superbire: <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc22_26@6-12">Qui major est vestrum, fiat sicut minor,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Matth. X)</note>-->.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e125">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_7@1-2">Gemmula carbunculi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir32-Rd1e132"><name xml:id="gom-sir32-Nd1e133" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e136"><seg type="qs">Ardentium gemmarum principatum tenet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et mysteria Dominicae passionis digno veneratur sacramento.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e145">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e147">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e149">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e151" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_14@1-2">Ante grandinem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir32-Rd1e154"><name xml:id="gom-sir32-Nd1e155" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e158">Fulgor coruscationis praeibit pondus grandinis; sic nitor gratiae <pb ed="#P" n="1216C"/> verecundiam.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e167">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_15@2-3">Hora surgenti.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir32-Rd1e174"><name xml:id="gom-sir32-Nd1e175" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e178"><seg type="qs">Admonet ne simus tristes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui per gratiam nos fecit, et bonis [operibus] omnibus replevit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e188">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e190">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e192">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e194" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_22@1-2">Vir consilii.</quote>
            Quanto quis prudentior, tanto utitur proximorum consilio, ut addat sibi intelligentiam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir32-Dd1e199">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir32-Hd1e201">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir32-d1e203">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir32-Qd1e205" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir32_24@1-3">Fili, sine consilio.</quote>
            Possunt haec de catholico et haeretico accipi. Catholicus enim Deum timens omnia agit doctorum consilio et Scripturarum documento. Haereticus vero propria confidens sapientia, et propriis instat inventionibus: sed cum stultitia ejus apparuerit, per sanctos praedicatores divinis arguetur sententiis
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
